{"author":{"id":"a66e0db0201c515c5090d5e52c036411dda9ba2f138110a926616a18a8ea0dd6"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790972123,"nonce":"OHGMtzhsFS5mqwc1IEU2Uroyrqo=","title":"x-idl comes from the sibling checkout, not a pinned revision","message":"Cargo.toml patches x_idl to ../x-idl, because xgpu-bindgen uses x-idl's `Library` (HashLink library naming) and the HashLink Bytes layout. Neither is in a revision x-idl has pushed: they are at x-idl 3435b2905e1804712f3d1b8addfbeb6ee876048f, local, as of 2026-10-02. CI's `cargo test --workspace --locked` cannot build without that checkout beside the repository.\n\nOnce x-idl is pushed: remove the patch, bump the x_idl git dependency to the pushed revision, and regenerate Cargo.lock.","files":null}]}